  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PII&#x2019;s Global Citizenship Education (GCE) Programme advances engagement in global justice through youth-led advocacy, education, and international collaboration. It integrates formal, informal, and non-formal learning, empowering young people with leadership skills and activism opportunities. Social media outreach and digital tools amplify its impact, while teacher training enhances classroom engagement. Aligned with Irish Aid&#x2019;s GCE Strategy, the programme fosters critical thinking, inclusivity, and global solidarity, ensuring sustained momentum in addressing pressing justice issues.</narrative>
  </description>
